## Read-only exact CAD data for Base exporters (luce-usd writes CAD faces as
## USD NurbsPatch prims): the support surface CadModel.face_support and
## BrepModel.face_support return; their face_trim_uv gives the trim loops in
## the support's UV chart (model/exact.lucb, brep/exact.lucb). Base only:
## Luce reaches CAD through `cad` and `cad_geometry`.
import brep

pub type FaceSupport = brep.FaceSupport
